ֵכֶט ); see also Isa 53:8 (of suffering servant of לָ֑מוֺ נֶגַע ׳י, ). 3 mark (60 t. Lev 13:14 ), indeterm. 13:5-6 , ( מִסְמַּחַת ), 13:17 ; 13:29 ; 13:30 ; 13:32 ; 13:43 ; 13:44 ; of leprosy, regarded as the heavy touch or stroke of a disease, ׳נ צָרַ֫עַת 13:2 +; 13:51 ( הַנּ מַמְאֶרֶת ׳צָרַעַת ), 13:59 ; 14:3 , 32 , 54 , Deut 24:8 ; also ׳נ הַנֶּתֶק Lev 13:31 ; ׳נ אֲדַמְדָּם לָבָן 13:42 ; identification with person having it 13:4 , 12 , 13 , 17 , 31 ; in garment, etc. 13:47 15 t. Leviticus 13; in house 14:34-35 , 36 , 43 , 44 , 48 (twice in verse); i.e. house-wall 14:37 ; 14:37 ; 14:39 ; in stones of wall 14:40 ; = garment, etc., with plague-spot 13:50 .","rootNote":"from 5060 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 8 37","keyReferences":["1Kgs 8 37","1Kgs 8 38","2Chr 6 28","2Chr 6 29","2Sam 7 14","Deut 17 8","Deut 17 8","Deut 21 5"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":78,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 8 37","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":37,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נֶ֖גַע","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 38","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":38,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נֶ֣גַע","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Chr 6 28","book":"2Chr","chapter":6,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נֶ֖גַע","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 6 29","book":"2Chr","chapter":6,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נִגְע/וֹ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"2Sam 7 14","book":"2Sam","chapter":7,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בְ/נִגְעֵ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"Deut 17 8","book":"Deut","chapter":17,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נֶ֨גַע֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 17 8","book":"Deut","chapter":17,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לָ/נֶ֔גַע","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},